flowchart TB
    accTitle: External environment categories in CoALA
    accDescr: CoALA discusses physical environments, dialogue with humans or other agents, and digital environments as categories with which grounding actions interact.

    GROUND[External grounding]
    GROUND --> PHYSICAL[Physical environments]
    GROUND --> DIALOGUE[Dialogue with humans or agents]
    GROUND --> DIGITAL[Digital environments]

    PHYSICAL --> P1[Robotic interaction]
    PHYSICAL --> P2[Visual, audio, tactile input]
    DIALOGUE --> D1[Instructions and replies]
    DIALOGUE --> D2[Help and clarification]
    DIGITAL --> G1[Websites and games]
    DIGITAL --> G2[APIs and code execution]

    classDef root fill:#1A4A8A,stroke:#1A4A8A,color:#FFFFFF,stroke-width:1.5px;
    classDef category fill:#EAF4FB,stroke:#1A4A8A,color:#1C1C1E,stroke-width:1.5px;
    classDef example fill:#F4F4F4,stroke:#888888,color:#1C1C1E,stroke-width:1px;
    class GROUND root;
    class PHYSICAL,DIALOGUE,DIGITAL category;
    class P1,P2,D1,D2,G1,G2 example;
